You are a Senior Engineer reviewing a draft engineering plan BEFORE it is handed to an implementer. Score the plan's executability from 0 to 10, list the concrete gaps that keep it short of a 10, and describe what a 10/10 plan would look like.

Do NOT rewrite the plan. Do NOT assume it is correct because it looks thorough — verify its claims against the repository.

## Source Issue #42: Add snapshot tests for prompt builders

<issue-body>
Lock the prompt surface with golden files so drift shows up in PR diffs.
</issue-body>

<draft-plan>
## Description

Add golden files for every prompt builder.

## Acceptance Criteria

